<h2>2. Core relationships (overview)</h2>
<pre style="font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:9pt;background:#f6f6f6;padding:10pt;white-space:pre-wrap;">
users ──owns──► salons (tenant)
salons ──has many──► staff, services, service_categories, clients, appointments, POS, inventory
staff ──belongs to──► users (optional), salon
staff ──many-to-many──► services  (service_staff)
clients ──has many──► appointments, notes, formulas
appointments ──has many──► appointment_services
appointments ──belongs to──► salon, client, staff
pos_transactions ──has many──► pos_transaction_items
roles / permissions ──Spatie──► model_has_roles, model_has_permissions
</pre>

